{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexBattles.yarn-lanetesBossCutscene-4518": "ALEXANDRA: 我……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexBattles.yarn-windStalkerBossCutscene-4519": "ALEXANDRA: 刚、刚才是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexBattles.yarn-windStalkerBossCutscene-4520": "JUNA: 是魔法呀，小姑娘。我就盼着这一刻呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexBattles.yarn-windStalkerBossCutscene-4521": "ALEXANDRA: 感觉……怪怪的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexBattles.yarn-windStalkerBossCutscene-4522": "JUNA: 要不，你也用个法术还它一招？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexBattles.yarn-windStalkerBossCutscene-4523": "ALEXANDRA: ……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexBattles.yarn-windStalkerBossCutscene-4524": "招式“投石”变为“岩片”！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexBattles.yarn-windStalkerBossCutscene-4525": "招式“寻找掩护”变为“坚如磐石”！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexBattles.yarn-windStalkerBossCutscene-4526": "招式“冲撞”变为“巨岩冲撞”！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexBattles.yarn-windStalkerBossCutscene-4527": "御风猎手隐身了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexBattles.yarn-lanetesBossBattle-4528": "消隐",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexBattles.yarn-shopRatBattle-4529": "ALVIN: 亚历？你在干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-birdNotice-4530": "ALEXANDRA: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-birdNotice-4531": "LOUIS: 亚历，能把那东西抓住吗？它从外面飞进来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-birdNotice-4532": "LOUIS: 还叼走了应收账簿最上面那页。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-birdNotice-4533": "ALEXANDRA: 啊！那页可不能丢！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-birdTriggerFinal-4534": "<align=\"center\">等等。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-birdTriggerFinal-4535": "ALEXANDRA: 鸟会说话！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-birdTriggerFinal-4536": "<align=\"center\">说话的不是她，是我。她只是我的眼睛。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-birdTriggerFinal-4537": "<align=\"center\">他们来了。你得离开这里。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-birdTriggerFinal-4538": "ALEXANDRA: 谁来了？还有，我怎么在跟一只鸟说话……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-birdTriggerFinal-4539": "<align=\"center\">回头看看你来的方向。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-birdTriggerFinal-4540": "ALEXANDRA: 警察！？一定是来找阿尔文的！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-birdTriggerFinal-4541": "<align=\"center\">这边！快！</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexCantReturn-4542": "ALEXANDRA: （还在干什么？得赶紧离开！）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-serenBirdFlight-4543": "<align=\"center\">跟着她往南走，过河。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-zooIntro-4544": "ALEXANDRA: 我走了半座城，结果来到……动物园？简直疯了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-zooIntro-4545": "<align=\"center\">我是想帮你。趁他们还在交班，赶紧进去，不然大门就关了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-zooIntro-4546": "到右上方的围栏来。别走大路，他们会看见你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-birdJumperZoo-4547": "爬到这儿来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-birdJumperZoo-4548": "鱼正在进食。要是从它们头顶跳过去，它们闹出的动静会惊动守卫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-fishReset-4549": "GUARD: 喂！你在里面干什么！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-fishReset2-4550": "GUARD: 喂！你在里面干什么！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-zooRockOut1-4551": "<align=\"center\">跳上去。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-zooRockOut1-4552": "ALEXANDRA: 现在呢？这围栏我可翻不过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-zooRockOut1-4553": "<align=\"center\">我送你一程。一……二……三……</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-zooRockOut1-4554": "<align=\"center\">继续走。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-zooPenJump2-4555": "狼现在不在围栏里，不过黑灯瞎火的，路可能不好找。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-forestToStreet-4556": "快到了。我再帮你一次。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-forestToStreet-4557": "进下一处围栏。马上就到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4558": "ALEXANDRA: 我在梦里……见过你？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4559": "那可不只是梦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4560": "ALEXANDRA: 等等，谁在说话？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4561": "????: 抱歉，是我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4562": "????: 我刚才把声音传到了别处，忘了改回来，我叫朱娜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4563": "ALEXANDRA: 你……你怎么会说话？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4564": "JUNA: 声音不就是空气振动嘛，我能用魔法让空气这样振动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4565": "ALEXANDRA: 我问的不是……等等，魔法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4566": "JUNA: 对。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4567": "ALEXANDRA: 为什么把我带到这里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4568": "JUNA: 我在星界见过你，有东西在追猎你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4569": "JUNA: 不过，也有东西在追猎我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4570": "ALEXANDRA: 我不行了……刚才发生了那么多事，我根本弄不明白。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4571": "ALEXANDRA: 那东西从哪儿来的？为什么河马会说话？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4572": "ALEXANDRA: 为什么……怎么会……刚才到底都是些什么啊？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4573": "????: 近一百五十年来，你是第一个能使用土系魔法的人类。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4574": "????: 我本以为，这种事再也不会发生了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4575": "????: 可朱娜一直坚信会有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4576": "JUNA: 这位是梅尔罗医生，动物园的兽医。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4577": "MELRAUX: 朱娜是第一个从荒野来到这里，还指名要找我的动物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaMeeting-4578": "MELRAUX: 我们换个暖和些的地方说话，好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4579": "MELRAUX: 今天你可经历了不少事，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4580": "ALEXANDRA: 我不明白刚才是怎么回事，那是什么东西？它对我做了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4581": "MELRAUX: 御风猎手？看来，它让你潜藏的魔法力量显现了出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4582": "MELRAUX: 你好像还有点糊涂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4583": "MELRAUX: 还有什么想知道的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4584": "御风猎手是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4585": "ALEXANDRA: 御风猎手是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4586": "MELRAUX: 嗯，它是来自东方的一种鹰形目捕食者，有趣的是，它们最近才演化出使用魔法的能力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4587": "MELRAUX: 可惜，正是这种新获得的魔法，让它们重创了朱娜的族群，朱娜只好跟几个亲族一起往西逃。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4588": "MELRAUX: 但你们刚才对付的那只还是一路追了过来，最后活着赶到我们这里的，就只剩朱娜了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4589": "等等，魔法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4590": "ALEXANDRA: 您说“魔法”？真的存在？那些都是真的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4591": "MELRAUX: 是的，魔法真的存在，只是近一百五十年来，人类已经失去了它……至少我们国家是这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4592": "MELRAUX: 东北荒野的许多动物却一直拥有魔法，朱娜就是其中之一。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4593": "MELRAUX: 朱娜说，出生在东方的人类仍能像她一样使用魔法，虽然我没见过，但没有理由怀疑她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4594": "ALEXANDRA: 那我呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4595": "MELRAUX: 我也不知道你为什么会有别人没有的力量，也许得问朱娜，或是东方的施法者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4596": "MELRAUX: 我们国家的人以前最擅长的是土系魔法，如今的野生动物也依然擅长这一系。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4597": "朱娜是什么来历？她经历了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4598": "ALEXANDRA: 朱娜是什么来历？她经历了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4599": "MELRAUX: 朱娜是一头尤鲁兽，这是一种有智慧的群居食草动物，原生地并不在尼巴罗斯山脉这一侧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4600": "MELRAUX: 就在过去这一千年间，它们学会了借助魔法，说出人类的语言。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4601": "MELRAUX: 朱娜被御风猎手伤得很重，我这几个月一直在为她治疗，好在她如今终于完全康复了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4602": "没有别的问题了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4603": "ALEXANDRA: 我想知道的就这些……一下子知道得太多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4604": "MELRAUX: 现在朱娜的伤好了，御风猎手也被消灭了，我们打算让她回东方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4605": "MELRAUX: 她想看看，还能不能找到自己族群的其他成员。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4606": "MELRAUX: 你可以跟她一起去，东方有其他像你一样的人，凭你们两个的力量，路上应该相当安全。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4607": "ALEXANDRA: 我不……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4608": "MELRAUX: 想一想，再跟她谈谈吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-melrauxZooTalk-4609": "没有别的问题了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaZooTalk-4610": "JUNA: 你还好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaZooTalk-4611": "ALEXANDRA: 今天出门时，我可没想到要跟那种……东西打架。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaZooTalk-4612": "JUNA: 抱歉。园里的人也试过抓住它、除掉它，可它每次都会隐身。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaZooTalk-4613": "JUNA: 你还是找医生聊聊吧。你的问题，她比我更能答得上来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaZooTalk-4614": "JUNA: 你还是找医生聊聊吧。你的问题，她比我更能答得上来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaZooTalk-4615": "好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaZooTalk-4616": "那星界呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaZooTalk-4617": "ALEXANDRA: 那星界呢？她没去过那里吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaZooTalk-4618": "JUNA: 哦，对。其实……我对那里也不太了解。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaZooTalk-4619": "JUNA: 听说星界是人类在很久以前创造的。就算不是，至少人类也改变过它的运作方式。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaZooTalk-4620": "JUNA: 只是后来，人类不再使用星界了。如今那里主要成了我们这些动物远距离交流的地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-junaZooTalk-4621": "JUNA: 我那时就在星界寻找其他同族，结果被你的噩梦卷了进去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-zooBouncer1-4622": "ALEXANDRA: （走大路会被守卫看见。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-zooBouncer2-4623": "ALEXANDRA: （走大路会被守卫看见。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-zooBouncer3-4624": "ALEXANDRA: （走大路会被守卫看见。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexChapterEnd-4625": "JUNA: 所以，你跟我一起往东去吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexChapterEnd-4626": "ALEXANDRA: 我连那边有什么都不知道。我这辈子一直住在塞伦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexChapterEnd-4627": "JUNA: 嗯，有几片很棒的草场，可以带你看看。你要是有兴趣的话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexChapterEnd-4628": "JUNA: 不过，说正经的。我们恐怕还是得找到其他像你一样的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexChapterEnd-4629": "JUNA: 你手上那个印记，也许他们就有办法处理。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexChapterEnd-4630": "ALEXANDRA: 那到底是什么？那个人对我做了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexChapterEnd-4631": "JUNA: 那是魔法印记，能让他再次找到你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexChapterEnd-4632": "ALEXANDRA: 怎么才能去掉？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexChapterEnd-4633": "JUNA: 得去东方，找个人类法师问问。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexChapterEnd-4634": "ALEXANDRA: 可是……我不能走。无论如何，我都不能……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexChapterEnd-4635": "JUNA: 只要那个人还抓着你妈妈，她就回不来。接下来，他也可能对你做同样的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexChapterEnd-4636": "ALEXANDRA: 可我根本就不想卷进这些事里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexChapterEnd-4637": "JUNA: 我知道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexChapterEnd-4638": "JUNA: 我也一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-wrongWayZoo-4639": "ALEXANDRA: （那只鸟好像没往这边走。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexABP-4640": "COP 1: 调度那边刚来消息，说在市中心找到那个当哥哥的了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexABP-4641": "COP 2: 那我们岂不是在这儿白忙活了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexABP-4642": "COP 1: 还没呢，上头要把他妹妹也一起抓了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexABP-4643": "COP 2: 嘿，还真是家族生意……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFinale.yarn-alexABP-4644": "ALEXANDRA: （糟了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFridge.yarn-serenFridge_auto-4645": "ALEXANDRA: （糟了！里面热起来了……还有股甜味……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFridge.yarn-serenFridge_auto-4646": "ALEXANDRA: （坏了，肯定是压缩机裂了！）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFridge.yarn-serenFridge_auto-4647": "ALEXANDRA: （好，别慌。别慌。别慌。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFridge.yarn-serenFridge_auto-4648": "ALEXANDRA: （还有三分钟，牛奶就会热得没法卖了……那些钱就全没了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFridge.yarn-serenFridge_auto-4649": "ALEXANDRA: （接着肉也会坏。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFridge.yarn-serenFridge_auto-4650": "ALEXANDRA: （不过不能慌。得养成好习惯。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFridge.yarn-serenFridge_auto-4651": "ALEXANDRA: （好，把箱子推到店里，打折卖掉！）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFridge.yarn-serenFridge_auto-4652": "按 \\[party\\] 重试",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFridge.yarn-serenFridge_crate-4653": "ALEXANDRA: 路易舅舅！把这些箱子拉出去，降价卖！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFridge.yarn-serenFridge_crate-4654": "ALEXANDRA: 再来一箱！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFridge.yarn-serenFridge_crate-4655": "ALEXANDRA: 还有两箱！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFridge.yarn-serenFridge_crate-4656": "ALEXANDRA: 还有一箱！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenFridge.yarn-serenFridge_crate-4657": "ALEXANDRA: 这是最后一箱！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenZoo.yarn-serenZoo_updateCameraHint-5014": "老鹰怒气：",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenZoo.yarn-serenZoo_updateCameraHint-5015": "老鹰怒气：X",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenZoo.yarn-serenZoo_updateCameraHint-5016": "老鹰怒气：X X",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenZoo.yarn-serenZoo_updateCameraHint-5017": "老鹰怒气：X X X",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenZoo.yarn-serenZoo_updateCameraHint-5018": "老鹰怒气：{0}",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenZoo.yarn-carefulEagle-5019": "这里小心点。在老鹰附近待太久，它会叫起来，惊动守卫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenZoo.yarn-carefulEagle-5020": "别靠得太近。它要是开始发怒，就躲起来，等它平静下来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/serenZoo.yarn-serenZoo_maybeAlertEagle-5021": "GUARD: 喂！你在里面干什么！？"
}
